OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions remain over Noah Donohoe
OL,4,Adisappearance, search commander says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Community Rescue Service commander,
OL,7,Fwho was in charge of the search for
OL,8,FNoah Donohoe in June 2020, says his
OL,9,Fmother's search for answers will
OL,10,Fcontinue.
OL,12,FOn Tuesday, the jury at the inquest
OL,13,Finto the schoolboy's death found the
OL,14,FDepartment for Infrastructure failed to
OL,15,Fidentify a hazard at a water tunnel in
OL,16,Fwhich Noah was found dead, and that
OL,17,Fthere was no warning sign.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
