OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions remain over Noah Donohoe
OL,4,Adisappearance, search commander says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey also found that neither the
OL,7,Fdepartment or the Police Service of
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) contributed in
OL,9,Fany way to Noah's death. However, they
OL,10,Fdid list 13 failings by police during
OL,11,Fthe investigation.
OL,13,FSean McCarry, who gave evidence at the
OL,14,Finquest, has said it was detailed, but
OL,15,Fsaid some questions still remain.
